+
+## What the example does
+
+1. Loads the pinned official MobileSAM `vit_t` source and checkpoint.
+2. Builds a wrapper with fixed positive point prompts.
+3. Calibrates PT2E quantization with `EthosUQuantizer`.
+4. Applies a stable softmax decomposition to transformer attention blocks.
+5. Lowers the complete quantized graph with `EthosUPartitioner`.
+6. Writes a `.pte`, builds the bare-metal runtime, executes it on FVP, and
+   compares the target mask with the host quantized result.
+7. Optionally builds a Zephyr application for the Alif Ensemble E8 DevKit and
+   runs the same export on Ethos-U85-256 hardware.
 
